[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/positron-ai/tron/issues/comments/6257190288","html_url":"https://github.com/positron-ai/tron/pull/5022#issuecomment-6257190288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/positron-ai/tron/issues/5022","id":6257190288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOKStajs8AAAABdPUlkA","user":{"login":"cursor[bot]","id":206951365,"node_id":"BOT_kgDODFXTxQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1210556?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/cursor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-19T00:38:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T00:38:17Z","body":"## PR Summary\n\n<!-- CURSOR_SUMMARY -->\n**Medium Risk**\nChanges performance-critical attention numerics and buffer layout for a new GQA shape; mitigated by compile-time gates, unchanged 4-head instantiations, and expanded dispatch/numerics tests.\n\n**Overview**\nExtends the Intel AMX dense attention fast path from **GQA group size 4 only** to **4 or 16 query heads per KV head** (head size 128, bf16 Q), so models like Muse Glimmer (kv_mul 16) can use AMX on full 64-token pages instead of the AVX dotter.\n\n**Kernels and API:** `pack_q_group_128x4`, `qk_rowmajor_128x4`, and `weights_times_v_128x4` are now templates on `group_heads`, gated by `group_heads_ok()` and explicit instantiations for 4 and 16. Eligibility (`shape_ok` / `eligible`) accepts kv_mul 4 or 16; other ratios still use AVX. Documentation and buffer contracts are generalized from fixed “4 heads” to `group_heads` (QK writes only real score rows; PV output still needs 16×128 fp32 for tile stores).\n\n**Implementation:** The Q pack loop iterates `group_heads` columns. QK’s post-tile AVX transpose is refactored (`store_transposed_rows`, compile-time lane count) so 16 heads fill one 16×16 tile without changing the four-head instruction path. PV converts softmax weights for all `group_heads` rows.\n\n**Dispatch:** `self_attention.hpp` passes `geometry.kv_mul()` into pack/QK/PV on the dense AMX page path.\n\n**Tests:** Dispatch fakes record template `group_heads` and add a 16-head section; numerics tests parameterize pack/QK/PV for both sizes and assert unused QK rows stay untouched for kv_mul 4.\n\n<sup>Reviewed by [Cursor Bugbot](https://cursor.com/bugbot) for commit 4c4b7b886485de971b968de579af170d50d73e04. Bugbot is set up for automated code reviews on this repo. Configure [here](https://www.cursor.com/dashboard/bugbot).</sup>\n<!-- /CURSOR_SUMMARY -->","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/positron-ai/tron/issues/comments/6257190288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":1210556,"client_id":"Iv23liGzp2hacMWjAyXc","slug":"cursor","node_id":"A_kwHOB44z8s4AEni8","owner":{"login":"cursor","id":126759922,"node_id":"O_kgDOB44z8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126759922?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor","html_url":"https://github.com/cursor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/